      "content": "The vLex Iceberg Anonymization API identifies and anonymizes names and personally identifiable information from any text input. Pre-trained on legal data to recognize personal names, organizations, and sensitive entities within legal documents, contracts, and court filings for privacy protection and data compliance workflows.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: vLex Developer Support",
